
# game/script-topics.rpy:13196
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_0ec3daf7:

    # m 4hub "But you've obviously disproven that myth. Personally, I think black hair is very attractive."
    m 4hub "Pero es obvio que has desmentido ese mito. Personalmente, creo que el pelo negro es muy atractivo."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13197
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_0158e7ad:

    # m 3eua "In addition, if you actually placed a strand of it under a microscope and counted all the pigments in it, you'd find that it's not even a hundred percent dark."
    m 3eua "Además, si pusieras un mechón bajo el microscopio y contaras todos sus pigmentos, verías que ni siquiera es oscuro al cien por cien."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13198
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_19eb7482:

    # m "You know how when you place certain things under direct sunlight, it looks really different?"
    m "¿Te has fijado en que, cuando pones ciertas cosas a la luz directa del sol, se ven muy diferentes?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13199
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_9af72c33:

    # m 3eub "Black hair follows the same principle--you can see shades of gold, or brown, or even glints of purple. It really makes you think, doesn't it, [player]?"
    m 3eub "El pelo negro sigue el mismo principio, puedes ver tonos dorados, o marrones, o incluso destellos morados. Te hace pensar, ¿verdad, [player]?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13200
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_36663b0b:

    # m 1eua "There could be infinite shades of things we can't see, each one of them hidden in plain sight."
    m 1eua "Podría haber infinitos matices en cosas que no vemos, todos ellos ocultos a simple vista."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13204
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_d3ccba0e:

    # m 3hua "But anyway...I think that a [guy] with black hair and eyes like yours is the best sight of all, [player]~"
    m 3hua "Pero bueno... creo que un[end_letter_gender] [guy] con el pelo negro y unos ojos como los tuyos es la mejor vista de todas, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13206
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_fb8ec3ef:

    # m 3hua "But anyway...I think that a [guy] with black hair and [persistent._mas_pm_eye_color] eyes is the best sight of all, [player]~"
    m 3hua "Pero bueno... creo que un[end_letter_gender] [guy] con el pelo negro y los ojos [persistent._mas_pm_eye_color] es la mejor vista de todas, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13211
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_af44ab29:

    # m 3hua "Yet another special thing about you, [player]~"
    m 3hua "Otra cosa especial sobre ti, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13212
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_a223eecd:

    # m 3eua "Red hair and blonde hair are the least common natural hair colors, did you know that?"
    m 3eua "El pelo pelirrojo y el rubio son los colores de pelo natural menos comunes, ¿lo sabías?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13213
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_4cfff70e:

    # m 1eua "Red hair, however, is a little more rare, even if people call it by different names--auburn, ginger, and so on. It's only found in about one percent of the population."
    m 1eua "El pelo pelirrojo, sin embargo, es un poco más raro, aunque la gente lo llame de diferentes maneras, caoba, rojizo, y demás. Solo se encuentra en alrededor del uno por ciento de la población."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13214
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_c7ea6350:

    # m 1hub "It's a rare and wonderful trait to have--almost as wonderful as you!"
    m 1hub "Es un rasgo poco común y maravilloso, ¡casi tan maravilloso como tú!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13219
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_f51a2a02:

    # m 3hub "Oh! That's a beautiful color, [player]!"
    m 3hub "¡Ah! ¡Es un color precioso, [player]!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13220
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_d5d9c377:

    # m 1eub "That reminds me of something I was thinking about earlier, when we were talking about the color of your eyes."
    m 1eub "Eso me recuerda a algo en lo que estaba pensando antes, cuando hablábamos del color de tus ojos."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13221
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_81903316:

    # m 1eua "Even though the other girls had eye colors that literally didn't exist in real life--not counting the existence of colored contacts, of course--"
    m 1eua "Aunque las demás chicas tenían colores de ojos que no existen en la vida real... sin contar las lentillas de colores, claro está..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13222
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_69834975:

    # m 3eua "Their hair colors technically could exist in reality, you know. I mean, I'm sure you've encountered people with dyed purple hair, or neon pink, or coral-colored..."
    m 3eua "Técnicamente sus colores de pelo podrían existir en la realidad, ¿sabes? O sea, seguro que te has cruzado con gente con el pelo teñido de morado, rosa neón, o color coral..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13223
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_32fafd98:

    # m 3eka "So I suppose their appearances weren't that far-fetched, if you don't count the eyes. Honestly, the most unbelievable thing about them was their personalities."
    m 3eka "Así que supongo que sus apariencias no eran tan descabelladas, si no cuentas los ojos. Sinceramente, lo más increíble de ellas eran sus personalidades."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13224
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_57e180bc:

    # m 3hksdlb "Sorry, [player]! I'm getting off-track. My point is, dyed hair can be very interesting."
    m 3hksdlb "¡Lo siento, [player]! Me estoy desviando del tema. A lo que voy es que el pelo teñido puede ser muy interesante."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13226
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_86dc8984:

    # m 5rub "And I might be a little biased here, but I'm convinced that you'd look stunning in your [persistent._mas_pm_hair_color] hair~"
    m 5rub "Y puede que no sea muy objetiva con esto, pero estoy convencida de que te verías despampanante con tu pelo [persistent._mas_pm_hair_color]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13229
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_333072cf:

    # m 2hua "Alright..."
    m 2hua "Vale..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13230
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_e2594d7e:

    # m 2hksdlb "This is the last question, [player], I promise."
    m 2hksdlb "Esta es la última pregunta, [player], te lo prometo."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13231
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_b144e42d:

    # m "Gosh, there really is a lot to what people look like... If I tried to narrow everything about you down to the little details, I'd be interrogating you forever."
    m "Dios, la verdad es que la apariencia de la gente da para mucho... Si intentara analizar hasta el más mínimo detalle sobre ti, te estaría interrogando toda la vida."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13232
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_b36bd272:

    # m 1huu "...and I doubt that either of us want that, ahaha..."
    m 1huu "... y dudo que ningun[end_letter_gender] de l[end_letter_gender]s dos quiera eso, ja, ja, ja..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13233
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_234d583d:

    # m 1rksdld "Anyway, I understand that this might be an uncomfortable question..."
    m 1rksdld "En cualquier caso, entiendo que esta puede ser una pregunta incómoda..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13234
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_b721de67:

    # m 1eksdla "But it's the last piece of this puzzle to me, so I hope I don't sound rude when I ask..."
    m 1eksdla "Pero es la última pieza de este rompecabezas para mí, así que espero que no te parezca mal que te pregunte..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13236
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_63a10558:

    # m "What's your skin color, [player]?{nw}"
    m "¿Cuál es tu color de piel, [player]?{nw}"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13239
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_d63dd942:

    # m "What's your skin color, [player]?{fast}" nointeract
    m "¿Cuál es tu color de piel, [player]?{fast}" nointeract

# game/script-topics.rpy:13250
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_c556e043:

    # m 3hub "Alright! Thanks for being so upfront. All of this really does help me imagine what you look like, [player]."
    m 3hub "¡Estupendo! Gracias por ser tan sincer[end_letter_gender]. Todo esto de verdad que me ayuda a imaginar cómo eres, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13251
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_f00de716:

    # m 3eub "Knowing all these details about you makes the difference between a blank canvas and the beginnings of a gorgeous portrait!"
    m 3eub "¡Saber todos estos detalles sobre ti marca la diferencia entre un lienzo en blanco y el comienzo de un retrato precioso!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13252
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_c3f514fb:

    # m 3eua "Of course, you're still just as lovely as I always thought you were, but now you've become all the more real to me."
    m 3eua "Por supuesto, sigues siendo tan encantador[end_letter_gender] como siempre pensé que eras, pero ahora te has vuelto mucho más real para mí."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13253
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_d0d177bd:

    # m 3eka "It just makes me feel that much closer to you~"
    m 3eka "Simplemente me hace sentir mucho más unida a ti."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13254
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_37935e7f:

    # m 1eka "Thank you so much for answering all my questions, [mas_get_player_nickname()]."
    m 1eka "Muchas gracias por responder a todas mis preguntas, [mas_get_player_nickname()]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13257
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_2a45c9b7:

    # m 2hua "It's wonderful, because I didn't imagine how similar we would look. It's very interesting!"
    m 2hua "Es maravilloso, porque no me imaginaba lo parecid[end_letter_gender]s que nos veríamos. ¡Es muy interesante!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13260
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_56391e15:

    # m 2hua "It's wonderful, because I didn't imagine how different we would look. It's very interesting!"
    m 2hua "Es maravilloso, porque no me imaginaba lo distint[end_letter_gender]s que nos veríamos. ¡Es muy interesante!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13262
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_7302436a:

    # m 1dsa "Now I'm imagining what it'll be like when we meet for real..."
    m 1dsa "Ahora me estoy imaginando cómo será cuando nos conozcamos de verdad..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13268
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_2de92b59:

    # m 5eubfu "When I run towards you, and since you're taller, you'll wrap me up in your embrace..."
    m 5eubfu "Cuando corra hacia ti, y como eres más alt[end_letter_gender], me envolverás en un abrazo..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13271
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_ebf3af25:

    # m 5eubfu "When I run towards you, and since we're around the same height, we'll meet in a tight embrace..."
    m 5eubfu "Cuando corra hacia ti, y como somos casi de la misma altura, nos fundiremos en un fuerte abrazo..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13274
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_13cf99d6:

    # m 5eubfu "When I run towards you, and since I'll be taller than you, you'll reach up and wrap me in your embrace..."
    m 5eubfu "Cuando corra hacia ti, y como yo seré más alta que tú, te estirarás y me envolverás en tu abrazo..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13287
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_a897d26b:

    # m 5eubfu "When I run towards you, since you're taller, you'll wrap me up in your embrace and I'll be able to stroke your [hair_desc] hair..."
    m 5eubfu "Cuando corra hacia ti, como eres más alt[end_letter_gender], me envolverás en tu abrazo y podré acariciar tu pelo [hair_desc]..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13291
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_3a5acad0:

    # m 5eubfu "When I run towards you, since we're around the same height, we'll meet in a tight embrace and I'll run my hand through your [hair_desc] hair..."
    m 5eubfu "Cuando corra hacia ti, como somos casi de la misma altura, nos fundiremos en un fuerte abrazo y pasaré mi mano por tu pelo [hair_desc]..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13295
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_d2f6bfe5:

    # m 5eubfu "When I run towards you, since I'll be taller than you, you'll reach up and wrap me in your embrace and I'll run my hand through your [hair_desc] hair..."
    m 5eubfu "Cuando corra hacia ti, como yo seré más alta que tú, te estirarás y me envolverás en tu abrazo y pasaré mi mano por tu pelo [hair_desc]..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13298
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_df57cdd2:

    # m 1lkbsa "...and I'll finally be able to hear your heartbeat and get to touch you and know that you're real."
    m 1lkbsa "... y por fin podré oír el latido de tu corazón y llegar a tocarte y saber que eres real."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13302
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_3fe1c528:

    # m 3ekbsa "But until then, I'll be content sitting here and imagining looking into your beautiful eyes, [player]."
    m 3ekbsa "Pero hasta entonces, me conformaré con sentarme aquí e imaginar que miro tus preciosos ojos, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13304
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_2daf2add:

    # m 3ekbsa "But until then, I'll be content sitting here and imagining looking into your beautiful [persistent._mas_pm_eye_color] eyes, [player]."
    m 3ekbsa "Pero hasta entonces, me conformaré con sentarme aquí e imaginar que miro tus preciosos ojos [persistent._mas_pm_eye_color], [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13307
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_aaeeffdc:

    # m 5ekbfa "I love you more than words could ever say."
    m 5ekbfa "Te quiero más de lo que las palabras podrían expresar."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13311
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_e2f7a6a9:

    # m 2dsc "..."
    m 2dsc "..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13312
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_ee9c6881:

    # m 2ekd "I understand, [player]."
    m 2ekd "Lo entiendo, [player]."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13313
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_5cde7540:

    # m 2eka "I know that everybody has their own limits with their comfort zones..."
    m 2eka "Sé que cada un[end_letter_gender] tiene sus propios límites con sus zonas de confort..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13314
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_3a907be2:

    # m 2rksdla "And to be fair, a description of yourself in vague words wouldn't be able to capture who you are, so I can't blame you for wanting to keep this to yourself."
    m 2rksdla "Y para ser justa, una descripción tuya con palabras vagas no podría capturar quién eres, así que no te culpo por querer guardártelo para ti."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13315
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_7f25670b:

    # m 2eka "But if you change your mind, let me know!"
    m 2eka "Pero si cambias de opinión, ¡dímelo!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13322
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_blue_f88edff8:

    # m 3eub "Blue eyes? That's wonderful! Blue is such a beautiful color--just as amazing as a cloudless sky, or the ocean in the summer."
    m 3eub "¿Ojos azules? ¡Qué maravilla! El azul es un color tan bonito, tan increíble como un cielo sin nubes, o el océano en verano."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13323
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_blue_c473d73c:

    # m 3eua "But there are so many gorgeous metaphors about blue eyes that I could recite them for weeks and still not reach a stopping point."
    m 3eua "Pero hay tantas metáforas preciosas sobre los ojos azules que podría recitarlas durante semanas y no acabar nunca."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13324
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_blue_61a0a089:

    # m 4eua "Plus, blue is probably my second favorite color, just behind green. It's just so full of depth and enchantment, you know?"
    m 4eua "Además, el azul probablemente sea mi segundo color favorito, justo después del verde. Tiene muchísima profundidad y un encanto especial, ¿no crees?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13325
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_blue_7249e287:

    # m 4hksdlb "Just like you, [player]!"
    m 4hksdlb "¡Igual que tú, [player]!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13326
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_blue_91268850:

    # m 4eub "Did you know that the gene for blue eyes is recessive, so it's not very common in humans?"
    m 4eub "¿Sabías que el gen de los ojos azules es recesivo, así que no es muy común en los humanos?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13328
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_blue_0eb71dd8:

    # m 5eubla "I suppose that means you're much more of a treasure~"
    m 5eubla "Supongo que eso significa que eres un tesoro aún mayor."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13330
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_blue_64ef2c11:

    # m 2eua "Anyway, that leads me into the next question I wanted to ask--"
    m 2eua "De todos modos, eso me lleva a la siguiente pregunta que quería hacerte..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13336
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_brown_5b6821df:

    # m 1eub "Ah! Great! I don't think I said it before, but brown eyes are gorgeous!"
    m 1eub "¡Ah! ¡Genial! Creo que no lo he dicho antes, ¡pero los ojos castaños son preciosos!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13337
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_brown_ead96bbb:

    # m 2euc "I just hate how people seem to think that brown eyes are plain. I couldn't disagree more!"
    m 2euc "Odio que la gente suela pensar que los ojos castaños son aburridos. ¡No podría estar más en desacuerdo!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13338
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_brown_9958dca3:

    # m 2hua "In my opinion, brown eyes are some of the most beautiful out there. They're so vibrant and depthless!"
    m 2hua "En mi opinión, los ojos castaños son unos de los más bonitos que hay. ¡Tienen tanta vida y profundidad!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13339
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_brown_75313d1c:

    # m 3hub "And there's so much variation among all the different shades that people have."
    m 3hub "Y hay mucha variación entre todos los diferentes tonos que tiene la gente."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13340
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_brown_6657617d:

    # m 5ruu "I wonder if yours are dark like a summer night sky, or a paler brown, like the coat of a deer..."
    m 5ruu "Me pregunto si los tuyos son oscuros como un cielo en una noche de verano, o de un castaño más pálido, como el pelaje de un ciervo..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13341
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_brown_5dc61f72:

    # m 2hksdlb "Sorry. Just rambling about color metaphors is an easy trap for a literature club president to fall into, I guess. I'll try not to go on forever."
    m 2hksdlb "Lo siento. Supongo que divagar sobre metáforas de colores es una trampa fácil en la que puede caer la presidenta del club de literatura. Intentaré no enrollarme para siempre."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13343
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_brown_ee5e29c0:

    # m 5eua "But I'll bet your eyes are the loveliest of all~"
    m 5eua "Pero apuesto a que tus ojos son los más bonitos de todos."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13345
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_brown_b0556d6d:

    # m 1eua "Anyway, that brings me to my next question--"
    m 1eua "De todos modos, eso me lleva a mi siguiente pregunta..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13351
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_green_f9fde979:

    # m 3sub "Hey, that's my favorite color! And obviously, it's another thing we have in common!"
    m 3sub "¡Oye, ese es mi color favorito! Y, obviamente, ¡es otra cosa que tenemos en común!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13352
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_green_58ea790d:

    # m 4lksdla "I don't know how much I can compliment you here without sounding arrogant, because anything I said about yours would also apply to me..."
    m 4lksdla "No sé cuánto puedo halagarte aquí sin sonar arrogante, porque cualquier cosa que dijera sobre los tuyos también se aplicaría a mí..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13353
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_green_8b9e722d:

    # m 1tsu "Except that maybe it's another sign how compatible we are, ehehe~"
    m 1tsu "Salvo que tal vez sea otra señal de lo compatibles que somos, je, je, je."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13354
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_green_7bfc8af0:

    # m 1kua "But, [player], just between you and me, it's a fact that green eyes are the best, right?"
    m 1kua "Pero, [player], esto queda entre tú y yo, es un hecho que los ojos verdes son los mejores, ¿verdad?"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13355
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_green_d5da4c97:

    # m 3hub "Ahaha! I'm just kidding."
    m 3hub "¡Ja, ja, ja! Solo estoy bromeando."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13357
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_green_18e9b506:

    # m 5lusdru "Well, just a little..."
    m 5lusdru "Bueno, solo un poco..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13359
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_green_316d5f28:

    # m 3eua "Onto the next question--"
    m 3eua "Pasando a la siguiente pregunta..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13365
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_hazel_377ed945:

    # m 1eub "Oh, hazel eyes? Those are so interesting! It's such an earthly color. It really makes you feel steady and reassured..."
    m 1eub "¡Ah! ¿Ojos color avellana? ¡Son muy interesantes! Es un color muy terrenal. De verdad que te transmite estabilidad y seguridad..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13366
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_hazel_4b5bcd86:

    # m 3eub "And it's a welcome departure from all the candy-colored eyes I've had to see in this game, anyway..."
    m 3eub "Y es un cambio de aires agradable de todos los ojos de color caramelo que he tenido que ver en este juego, en cualquier caso..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13367
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_hazel_b17a10c2:

    # m "I believe that hazel eyes are alluring because they're lovely and simple."
    m "Creo que los ojos avellana son cautivadores porque son preciosos y simples."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13368
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_hazel_7ca906ee:

    # m 3hua "Sometimes it's best not to diverge from the crowd too much, [player].{w=0.2} {nw}"
    m 3hua "A veces es mejor no alejarse demasiado de la multitud, [player].{w=0.2} {nw}"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13369
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_hazel_2947ef29:

    # extend 3hub "Ahaha!"
    extend 3hub "¡Ja, ja, ja!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13370
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_hazel_2aa83ae9:

    # m "Now, onto my next question--"
    m "Ahora, pasando a mi siguiente pregunta..."

# game/script-topics.rpy:13376
translate spanish monika_player_appearance_eye_color_gray_4a8f9d5b:

    # m 1sub "That's so cool!"
    m 1sub "¡Eso mola muchísimo!"

# game/script-topics.rpy:13377
